<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-048" chapter-id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage" source-id="s-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage-ws1791560">
  <p id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage:p001:m0000" ref="wow_07g_swu">毛脩之</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage:p001:m0004" ref="wow_07g_swu">敬文</persName>，滎陽陽武人也。祖<persName id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage:p001:m0015" ref="d9b_790_9f0_A">虎生</persName>，伯父<persName id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage:p001:m0020" ref="m7n_39i_5bk">璩</persName>，並益州刺史。父<persName id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage:p001:m0029" ref="d9b_790_9f0_AB">瑾</persName>，梁、秦二州刺史。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">先是，<persName id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage:p002:m0003" ref="er7_nw6_n6w">劉敬宣</persName>女嫁，高祖賜錢三百萬，雜綵千匹，時人並以為厚賜。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage:p003:m0000" ref="j6y_10h_eso">脩之</persName>具答，并云：「賢子<persName id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage:p003:m0011" ref="wow_07g_swu_A">元矯</persName>，甚能自處，為時人所稱。」<persName id="c-songshu-048-maoxiu-son-and-marriage:p003:m0026" ref="wow_07g_swu">脩之</persName>悲不得言，直視良久，乃長歎曰：「嗚呼！」</p>
</text>
